#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:205
msgid ""
"By default, sbt runs all tasks in parallel and within the same JVM as sbt "
"itself. Because each test suite is mapped to a task, tests are also run in "
"parallel by default. To make tests within a given project execute serially:"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-test.md:213
msgid "Note that tests from different projects may still execute concurrently."
msgstr ""

